## Acceptance for the extension (whenever it is taken up)

* the existing `--selftest` still reports 23/23 (no behaviour change);
* the round-43 pack still gates green (exit 0, `rows_failed` empty);
* a map entry with `kind: "compressed"` and no `encoding` is red
  (`map-encoding-invalid` or a new `map-kind-encoding-mismatch`);
* a map entry with `members` naming a path the archive does not contain is red.

`build/r43-reverify.py` in this seat's artifacts already checks the member
lists member-by-member against the live/pinned substrate, which is what the
`members` key would make the gate do on its own.
